00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:43.840
That just seems to be kind
of a non-starter to deny that

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.460
for the last 400 years,

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.590
after we've been coming up
with theories of physics.

